SUMMARY:Demo: Planning a Successful Vegetable Garden\, Dufferin-St. Clair Library
DESCRIPTION:Want to enjoy vegetables you’ve grown yourself in your own backyard or on your balcony? A Toronto Master Gardener will lead a demonstration and show how to get started to grow your own vegetables. Get some tips and learn techniques for successful growing. At the end of the program\, vegetable seeds or seedlings will be shared with attendees\, while supplies last.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/demo-planning-a-successful-vegetable-garden-dufferin-st-clair-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public library – Duffrin/St. Clair\, 1625 Dufferin Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6H 3L9\, Canada
END:VEVENT
