DESCRIPTION:Pollinators need a supply of nectar throughout the growing season\, so if you are planting up pots for your garden or balcony\, why not choose plants that will attract birds\, bees\, and butterflies? This demonstration will start with how to choose soil\, plants\, and containers\, and how to arrange them to maximize their positive impact on the environment. At the end of the demonstration\, materials will be shared with participants\, while supplies last.
