BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Master Gardeners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260615T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260615T200000
DTSTAMP:20260603T010425
CREATED:20260209T161310Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260209T161310Z
UID:41763-1781550000-1781553600@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:Basics of urban vegetable gardening
DESCRIPTION:Growing (and eating!) your own vegetables has so many benefits. Come and discover the joy of growing your own food. You can’t beat the taste\, and you save some money while doing it. We cover all the bases including planning new garden beds\, the importance of soil\, starting seeds indoors\, crop rotation\, caring for your plants\, feeding/fertilizing and maximizing productivity by extending the growing season.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/basics-of-urban-vegetable-gardening-2/
END:VEVENT
